{"recommendationid": "232746803", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010191697", "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 13, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13, "last_played": 1786643988}, "language": "schinese", "review": "傻逼游戏草泥马的，进游戏提示按F离开，按了，直接摔死，活了上车，下车之后车自己溜车了，好几公里大下坡我追你妈逼里掏你制作组的篮子去？", "timestamp_created": 1786644217, "timestamp_updated": 1786644217, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.47413790225982666, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "refunded": false, "appid": 244850, "source": "official", "steamid": "76561198010191697", "playtime_forever": 13, "playtime_at_review": 13, "created_utc": "2026-08-13T18:03:37+00:00", "game_era": "other"}
{"recommendationid": "232582999", "author": {"steamid": "76561199065317328", "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 90951, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 103, "playtime_at_review": 90253, "last_played": 1793545622}, "language": "schinese", "review": "无法使用中文输入法，无论是微软还是搜狗，都不行\nInput method cannot be used, neither Microsoft nor sogou can.\n不解决这个问题，不推荐", "timestamp_created": 1786457972, "timestamp_updated": 1786716687, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5199409127235413, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "refunded": false, "hardware": {"os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13980HX", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU", "system_ram": "32386", "vram_size": 7956}, "appid": 244850, "source": "official", "steamid": "76561199065317328", "playtime_forever": 90951, "playtime_at_review": 90253, "created_utc": "2026-08-11T14:19:32+00:00", "game_era": "other"}
{"recommendationid": "232038232", "author": {"steamid": "76561198253600945", "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3189, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3104, "last_played": 1792311327}, "language": "schinese", "review": "什么逼脸涨价的  本来还想支持一下二代 一看价格翻了一倍 乐", "timestamp_created": 1785845706, "timestamp_updated": 1785845706, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.49794235825538635, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "refunded": false, "appid": 244850, "source": "official", "steamid": "76561198253600945", "playtime_forever": 3189, "playtime_at_review": 3104, "created_utc": "2026-08-04T12:15:06+00:00", "game_era": "other"}
{"recommendationid": "231903816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198158883796", "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 109297, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 106319, "last_played": 1788270680}, "language": "schinese", "review": "先说结论：它仍然是你能找到的画面最精致的太空船建造模拟器（除了自家的SE2），但不能当做合格的太空探索游戏来玩。\r\n\r\n先说结论的前半部分，作为模拟器，游戏自带了海量的方块可以使用，旋转，伸缩，折叠，各种可动功能都有，星球，太空，无缝衔接，编程块更是实现了要啥功能自己做的可自定义性，如果还不够，还有创意工坊来供玩家选择，建造这一块可以说同类领先，画面曾经过多次改进，现在看也仍然不算落后，美术风格也算得上美观。\r\n\r\n然后说后半部分，作为太空探索游戏，十年过去了，它仍然不及格，即使经过了近几年的修修补补，其本质仍然还是当年那个造完船就几乎没事干了的造船模拟器，现在的更新更像是加进去了几个挑战任务来让你测试飞船，还远远谈不上真正的游戏体验。\r\n\r\n最后是针对开发组的开发态度，如果说他们没在开发或者不知道玩家想要什么，那是假的，但又很难说得上勤奋，差强人意这个词，可以说是对他们最好的形容，也就是仅仅略微高于及格线，没完全摆烂的程度。\r\n\r\n总而言之，就像开头说的，截至目前为止，合格的造船模拟器，失败的太空探索游戏。（顺便祝我自己能活到后半部分也合格的那一天）", "timestamp_created": 1785685385, "timestamp_updated": 1785685385, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.6214343905448914, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "refunded": false, "appid": 244850, "source": "official", "steamid": "76561198158883796", "playtime_forever": 109297, "playtime_at_review": 106319, "created_utc": "2026-08-02T15:43:05+00:00", "game_era": "other"}
